{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Player": 6,
    "Ulman": 30
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7065201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ulman",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "706520101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "706520101": {
            "id": "706520101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "*sigh* What am I to do...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520102"
            ]
          },
          "706520102": {
            "id": "706520102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Something the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520103"
            ]
          },
          "706520103": {
            "id": "706520103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Oh, so it's you, Traveler... It's nothing, just a small problem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520104"
            ]
          },
          "706520104": {
            "id": "706520104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "This Treasure-Seeking Seelie has suddenly stopped paying any attention to me, so I'm in a bit of a fix...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520105"
            ]
          },
          "706520105": {
            "id": "706520105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You... can speak to Seelie?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520106"
            ]
          },
          "706520106": {
            "id": "706520106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Well, I wouldn't call it speaking. That would be exaggerating. We are, ultimately, the guide and the guided.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520107"
            ]
          },
          "706520107": {
            "id": "706520107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "I picked this fellow up inside a ruin. It was trapped at that time — took me quite a bit of effort to extricate it, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520108"
            ]
          },
          "706520108": {
            "id": "706520108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "I guess it must have wanted to thank me... After that, it would sometimes lead me to find some treasure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520109"
            ]
          },
          "706520109": {
            "id": "706520109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "I actually made quite the pile with its help...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520110"
            ]
          },
          "706520110": {
            "id": "706520110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "But for whatever reason, the Seelie's stopped paying me any mind as of late.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520111"
            ]
          },
          "706520111": {
            "id": "706520111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "If you ask me... I think it's looking for a new partner.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520112"
            ]
          },
          "706520112": {
            "id": "706520112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "I daren't give it away carelessly, but I can't find any reliable hands to team up with at short notice, either...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520113"
            ]
          },
          "706520113": {
            "id": "706520113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You could look for your companions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520114"
            ]
          },
          "706520114": {
            "id": "706520114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Companions? Hah! Bunch of greedy churls, they are. I wouldn't trust them as far as I could throw them, to say nothing of working with them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520115"
            ]
          },
          "706520115": {
            "id": "706520115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "If I didn't need the extra information and leads, I'd have left them a long time ago...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520116"
            ]
          },
          "706520116": {
            "id": "706520116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Hmm... How about this, then? What would you say to working with me, Traveler?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520117"
            ]
          },
          "706520117": {
            "id": "706520117",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm no expert in Seelie communications...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520118"
            ]
          },
          "706520118": {
            "id": "706520118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Hahaha, it doesn't matter! The way I see it, this Treasure-Seeking Seelie took a real shine to you the moment it saw you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520119"
            ]
          },
          "706520119": {
            "id": "706520119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "It didn't react at all when it saw those \"companions\" of mine, let me tell you that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520120"
            ]
          },
          "706520120": {
            "id": "706520120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "So, how about it? What say we team up and earn ourselves a pretty sum?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520121"
            ]
          },
          "706520121": {
            "id": "706520121",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll... give it a go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520122"
            ]
          },
          "706520122": {
            "id": "706520122",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Hahaha, great! Partners, then!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520123"
            ]
          },
          "706520123": {
            "id": "706520123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Come, take this Treasure-Seeking Seelie — you're partners in the venture too, after all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520124"
            ]
          },
          "706520124": {
            "id": "706520124",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, about this \"treasure-seeking\" business...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520125"
            ]
          },
          "706520125": {
            "id": "706520125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Ah, yes, it almost slipped my mind. Hmm, let me think... Well, this Treasure-Seeking Seelie is different from other Seelie...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520126"
            ]
          },
          "706520126": {
            "id": "706520126",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "It won't lead you to the spot where treasure is hidden, but it will give you hints as to whether treasure is nearby or far away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520127"
            ]
          },
          "706520127": {
            "id": "706520127",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Basically, it'll twinkle, see?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520128"
            ]
          },
          "706520128": {
            "id": "706520128",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Also, this fellow isn't all that fond of popping out most of the time, so you'll have to wake it up from time to time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520129"
            ]
          },
          "706520129": {
            "id": "706520129",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Once it's awake, it will guide you. But it doesn't stay out for very long, so you're going to have to focus.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520130"
            ]
          },
          "706520130": {
            "id": "706520130",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Oh, right. When you go treasure hunting with it, you might also encounter some <color=#00E1FFFF>Iron Coins</color> to go with your loot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520131"
            ]
          },
          "706520131": {
            "id": "706520131",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Most merchants won't take this ancient currency, but you can give them to me instead. I have my uses for them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520132"
            ]
          },
          "706520132": {
            "id": "706520132",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "You can trade them in with me for suitable rewards, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520133"
            ]
          },
          "706520133": {
            "id": "706520133",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "As for the size of that reward... Well, that will depend on the amount of Iron Coins you have on you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520134"
            ]
          },
          "706520134": {
            "id": "706520134",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "And lastly, this book is for you. The locations marked out in this book most certainly have treasure — this is based on information that I've spent much time gathering.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520135"
            ]
          },
          "706520135": {
            "id": "706520135",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "Unfortunately, the Treasure-Seeking Seelie stopped listening to me before I could find these treasures.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706520136"
            ]
          },
          "706520136": {
            "id": "706520136",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ulman",
            "text": "So I suppose I can only rely on you now... Happy hunting!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}